quran[8]{c,v,t}:
  16,103,"And indeed, We know that they say: ‘It is only a human being who teaches him.’ The language of the person whom they falsely refer to is non-Arabic, while this (Qur’an) is (in) clear Arabic."
  16,104,"As for those who do not believe in Allah’s revelations, Allah will not guide them, and there is a painful punishment for them."
  16,105,Only those (people can) fabricate falsehood who do not believe in Allah’s revelations. And it is they who are liars.
  16,106,"Whoever renounces faith in Allah after (affirming) his belief, except for one who is forced while his heart is content with faith (as before). But whosoever opens his breast to disbelief, upon such (people) shall be Allah’s wrath, and there is a great punishment for them."
  16,107,"That is because they preferred this worldly life to the Hereafter. Indeed, Allah does not guide the disbelieving people."
  16,108,"They are the ones whose hearts, and their hearing, and their sight have been sealed by Allah. They are the ones who are neglectful (of their end in the Hereafter)."
  16,109,"No doubt, they are the ones who, in the Hereafter, will be the losers."
  16,110,"Then, your Lord (will forgive) those who migrated after being persecuted (to renounce Islam) and struggled hard and remained patient. Your Lord, most surely, after that, is Most Forgiving, All-Merciful."
